    "causal_summary": "The standalone cli-jortt skill turns Jortt REST operations into repeatable read-first extraction for a Moneybird migration. Its OpenAPI-driven jortt-cli finds all operations, checks scopes and write flags, merges paged responses and confines saved output to the ignored migration workspace. It sends XAF and other UI-only exports to the operator and hands target-side work to the sibling cli-moneybird skill.",
